 "remarks": "Investors! this is the one you've been waiting for! Move-in ready 1-bedroom, 1-bath unit offering immediate income potential. Featuring beautiful hardwood floors throughout, an updated kitchen with ample storage, and a renovated bath, this unit is both attractive and low-maintenance. Laundry is conveniently located within the building, and a large private storage area adds even more value. Located in a sought-after beach community, just a short walk to Cove Island Park, where you'll enjoy scenic walking and jogging loops, rollerblading paths, a skating rink, playground, and one of Stamford's most desirable beaches. Perfect for commuters with quick access to I-95 and Metro-North, and just minutes to shopping, restaurants, and entertainment. The roof assessment has already been paid, making this an even more appealing investment opportunity. Being sold as-is. Start generating income from day one! Don't miss out!",
